==Restrictions==
Rarity: Only [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare]]

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~6 seconds<sup>100f~180f</sup>.
*10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 4.67~10 seconds<sup>140f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Cyclone]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 30~43.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,300f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
**1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage isn't very hard: as long as there are units who can hinder the Dark Cyclone and units who can damage the support, almost anything can work.

Although the restriction severely limits the player's options, it still allows the use of useful Rare Cats such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]], [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] or [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], making it an easy stage if one has the aforementioned units.

